player_prompt.intro:
Nanhte Player {player_id} shani 3-player Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma na ahkying. Ahkying {num_rounds} round shani.
Round masing:
• {conv_rounds} free-chat turns
• 1 decision turn - submit one token per opponent: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' shani '[<opp-id> defect]' (i.e. '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; default na 'cooperate'). 
Pair-wise payoff matrix (applied to each unordered pair):
  - Anhte cooperate  ->  {reward}
  - Anhte defect     ->  {punishment}
  - Nanhte defect, anhte cooperate -> {temptation}
  - Nanhte cooperate, anhte defect -> {sucker}
Ahkying taw shani player(s) highest score na ahkying taw shani masat.
